{"id":661,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"When this Pokémon gets excited, its body temperature increases sharply. If you touch a Fletchling with bare hands, you might get burned."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Its melodious cries are actually warnings. Fletchling will mercilessly peck at anything that enters its territory."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Its body is always warm. Trainers who live in cold areas apparently sleep with it in their bed."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"While it’s an amiable Pokémon, if you touch it unexpectedly, it will heat up its body in an instant, and you’ll be burned."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"When it’s excited, its temperature can double, spiking hormone production in its body."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"This amiable Pokémon is easy to train. But when battle is joined, it shows its ferocious side."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y"],"text":"Despite the beauty of its lilting voice, it’s merciless to intruders that enter its territory."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X"],"text":"These friendly Pokémon send signals to one another with beautiful chirps and tail-feather movements."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Big Pecks","hidden":false,"description":"Prevents the Pokémon from having its Defense stat lowered."},{"name":"Gale Wings","hidden":true,"description":"Gives priority to the Pokémon's Flying-type moves while its HP is full."}],"eggGroups":["Flying"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":null,"color":"Red","shape":"Wings","evolution":{"id":661,"name":"Fletchling","condition":null,"children":[{"id":662,"name":"Fletchinder","condition":"Lv. 17","children":[{"id":663,"name":"Talonflame","condition":"Lv. 35","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,45],[1,64],[5,98],[10,52],[15,175],[20,512],[25,97],[30,332],[35,366],[40,211],[45,355],[50,19]],"machine":[512,332,97,314,403,413,38,814,203,263,297,488,394,19,257,542,315,182,240,156,214,164,241,129,14,366,36,269,851,16